      "message": "List the available pure-capability RVY ABIs\n\nThis adds the same matrix of soft and hardfloat ABIs as LP64 and ILP32,\nbut since pointers are now of 2*XLEN capabilities we use the C64/C128\nin the ABI name: LP64 -> L64PC128 and ILP32 -> IL32PC64.",
